# What the image build never reads, kept out of the context so a build does not
# begin by shipping a multi-gigabyte target directory to the daemon.
#
# Cargo.lock and rust-toolchain.toml are deliberately absent from this list.
# The build passes --locked, which needs the first, and takes its compiler
# version from the second; excluding either would break the build rather than
# slim it.

target/
.git/
docs/
tests/compliance/s3-tests/
.superpowers/
*.bundle
